    {
      "id": "e078c812-1f33-4200-aeb2-9d6891a6ead3",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 0,
      "data": {
        "title": "Quando RAG precisa ser local"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e3f0befe-b64a-4782-9db0-5e9f521c7fd4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Cenários comuns em 2026 onde dado NÃO pode sair: contratos legais (escritórios), prontuários médicos (hospitais), código proprietário (corporações), documentos confidenciais (defesa, governo). Toda chamada para OpenAI/Anthropic vira incidente de compliance. A alternativa: stack 100% local, do parsing à geração. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9c959486-3a43-4627-ae0d-930d2245b60c",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 1,
      "data": {
        "title": "A pilha em uma página"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "23803320-78c7-4d46-9bad-56ae6f82ef97",
          "type": "flow_diagram",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "title": "RAG local end-to-end",
            "orientation": "vertical",
            "steps": [
              {
                "icon": "📄",
                "label": "Ingest — docling",
                "desc": "PDF/DOCX/HTML → markdown estruturado"
              },
              {
                "icon": "✂️",
                "label": "Chunking semantic",
                "desc": "Splits semânticos (não fixed-size cego)"
              },
              {
                "icon": "🧬",
                "label": "Embed — BGE-M3",
                "desc": "Local via sentence-transformers"
              },
              {
                "icon": "🗄️",
                "label": "Index — LanceDB ou Qdrant",
                "desc": "Hybrid (dense + BM25)"
              },
              {
                "icon": "🔍",
                "label": "Retrieval + rerank",
                "desc": "RRF + BGE-reranker"
              },
              {
                "icon": "🤖",
                "label": "Generate — Ollama (Qwen 2.5)",
                "desc": "Local, sem rede externa"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "085d79ad-d2ac-4150-b017-6823a1758490",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 2,
      "data": {
        "title": "Setup mínimo"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "db5ab1b5-edaa-4bb3-bcb4-5e48a96d15fc",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "bash",
            "code": "# 1. Instalar Ollama + modelo\nbrew install ollama\nollama pull qwen2.5:14b           # ou llama3.3:70b se tiver VRAM\nollama pull bge-m3                # embedding model\n\n# 2. Python env\nuv venv && source .venv/bin/activate\nuv pip install docling lancedb sentence-transformers FlagEmbedding"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "bdf2bfb2-3124-4401-aa5d-351434f20e73",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "python",
            "code": "from docling import DocumentConverter\nfrom sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer\nimport lancedb\n\n# 1. Parse PDF mantendo estrutura\nconverter = DocumentConverter()\ndoc = converter.convert('contrato.pdf')\nchunks = doc.export_to_markdown().split('\\n\\n')  # simplificado\n\n# 2. Embed local (sem API)\nembedder = SentenceTransformer('BAAI/bge-m3')\nvectors = embedder.encode(chunks)\n\n# 3. Index local em LanceDB\ndb = lancedb.connect('./vault')\ntable = db.create_table('docs', data=[\n    {'text': c, 'vector': v.tolist()} for c, v in zip(chunks, vectors)\n])\n\n# 4. Query\nquery_vec = embedder.encode('cláusula de rescisão')\nresults = table.search(query_vec).limit(5).to_list()\n\n# 5. Generate com Ollama local\nimport ollama\nctx = '\\n\\n'.join(r['text'] for r in results)\nresponse = ollama.chat(\n    model='qwen2.5:14b',\n    messages=[{\n        'role': 'user',\n        'content': f'Contexto:\\n{ctx}\\n\\nPergunta: O que diz a cláusula de rescisão?'\n    }]\n)\nprint(response['message']['content'])"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8a24dd26-ea42-46ef-a9f0-c06110dc91e6",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 3,
      "data": {
        "title": "Hybrid search — código"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "dde5441e-c856-455b-8468-a80277c7d9dd",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "python",
            "code": "# LanceDB suporta hybrid nativamente com FTS + vector\nimport lancedb\nfrom lancedb.rerankers import LinearCombinationReranker\n\ndb = lancedb.connect('./vault')\ntable = db.open_table('docs')\n\n# Cria índice FTS (BM25-like) sobre 'text'\ntable.create_fts_index('text')\n\n# Hybrid search\nreranker = LinearCombinationReranker(weight=0.7)\nresults = (\n    table.search('cláusula rescisão contratual', query_type='hybrid')\n    .vector(embedder.encode('cláusula rescisão contratual').tolist())\n    .rerank(reranker=reranker)\n    .limit(10)\n    .to_list()\n)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "794d7dc5-c72b-4487-97f5-3b3984a9dcdc",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 4,
      "data": {
        "title": "Reranking com cross-encoder local"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "260dc69d-7b0b-484c-a427-c844c9d6ef7a",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "python",
            "code": "from FlagEmbedding import FlagReranker\n\n# Roda local — sem API\nreranker = FlagReranker('BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3', use_fp16=True)\n\n# Pair-wise scoring\npairs = [['cláusula rescisão', candidate['text']] for candidate in results[:50]]\nscores = reranker.compute_score(pairs, normalize=True)\n\n# Reorder\nreranked = sorted(zip(scores, results), reverse=True)[:5]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
